        "original_id": "7d49fe33-a5cd-5bba-bc4c-228a1c3ded68",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Prince Philip, Princess Elizabeth, Queen Elizabeth II\n- Titles: Earl of Merioneth, Duke of Edinburgh, Baron Greenwich\n- Organizations: Peerage of the United Kingdom\n\nFacts:\n- Prince Philip was born as Prince Philip of Greece and Denmark on 10 June 1921.\n- In 1947, the Peerage of the United Kingdom created the titles Earl of Merioneth, Duke of Edinburgh, and Baron Greenwich for Philip Mountbatten, R.N.\n- In 1947, Philip Mountbatten was the soon-to-be husband of Princess Elizabeth, who later became Queen Elizabeth II.\n- Prince Philip, Duke of Edinburgh, was the husband and consort of Queen Elizabeth II of the United Kingdom and the other Commonwealth realms.",
